{
  "sourceId": "post-handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform-zh-TW",
  "locale": "zh-TW",
  "source": {
    "kind": "single-post",
    "postId": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵在 Terraform 中使用 count = 0 來實現功能切換是很常見的。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，當它在資源中實作且功能被停用時，可能會導致空元組錯誤。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "元組是一種可以包含任意數量不同類型元素的列表類型。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "索引零用於存取已啟用的資源，例如 module.feature[0].id 。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當資源被停用時，元組為空，且 module.feature[0] 不存在，導致錯誤。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "例如，以下程式碼執行良好：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "輸出：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，當 my_tuple 為空時會拋出錯誤。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "輸出：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "功能切換是空元組的常見使用案例。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，空元組還有其他使用案例。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "例如，如果您使用的模組返回元組，您可能想處理元組為空的情況。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下是可用於在 Terraform 中處理空元組的技術，",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "處理空元組的直接方法是在嘗試存取元素之前使用條件表達式檢查元組是否為空。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下是如何使用條件表達式的範例：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在此範例中， length() 函式用於檢查 my_tuple 是否為空。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果 my_tuple 不為空，則第一個元素 ([0]) 中的 name 被指派給 result 變數。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果 my_tuple 為空，則「default-value」被指派給 result 變數。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不會拋出空元組錯誤，因為當 my_tuple 為空時不會評估 local.my_tuple[0].name 。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當變數名稱很長時，這可能難以閱讀，因為變數名稱在條件表達式中重複了兩次。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "處理空元組的另一種方法是使用 try() 函式。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "try() 函式用於嘗試存取值，如果值未定義則提供預設值。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下是如何使用 try() 函式的範例：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在此範例中， try() 函式用於嘗試存取 my_tuple 第一個元素 ([0]) 中的 name。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由於 my_tuple 為空，字串「default-value」被用作 value 的預設值。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在 Terraform 0.13.0 中，您可以使用 for 表達式來處理空元組：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "這是可讀性最低的方法，但帶我們進入下面的展開表達式：",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "for 表達式和展開表達式在 Terraform 0.12.29 中不受支援，但在 Terraform 0.13.0 及更高版本中受支援。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "此外，如果 my_tuple 為空，兩者都會返回空元組，與可以指定預設值的條件表達式和 try() 函式不同。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "舊版展開表達式 local.my_tuple.*.name 在 Terraform 0.12.29 及更高版本（截至本文發布日期為 v1.4）中也受支援。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "然而，不建議使用此方法，因為它可能在未來版本中被移除。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有關展開表達式的更多資訊，↵https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/expressions/splat",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "值得注意的是，表達式的結果是元組。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可能需要使用 tolist() 函式將其轉換為列表，或者如果您想刪除重複項和/或排序項目，則使用 toset() 函式。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "compact() 函式可用於從列表中刪除空字串和 null 值。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您還可以使用 join() 函式將列表轉換為字串。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "使用帶有動態區塊的 for_each meta-argument 可以是功能切換的一種方法，但超出了本文的範圍。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "https://support.hashicorp.com/hc/en-us/articles/9471971461651-ERROR-Invalid-index-on-empty-tuple↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform",
        "title": "在 Terraform 中處理列表中空元組的無效索引",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/handling-invalid-index-on-empty-tuple-from-list-in-terraform/"
      }
    }
  ],
